{"id":"aufregung","lemma":"Aufregung","pos":"noun","rank":2619,"glosses":["excitement","agitation"],"ipa":"/ˈaʊ̯fʁeːɡʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/De-Aufregung.ogg/De-Aufregung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Aufregung","plural":"Aufregungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Was soll die ganze Aufregung?","en":"What is all the fuss about?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41557","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},null]},{"text":"Es gibt keinen Grund zur Aufregung.","en":"There's nothing to worry about.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/565821","words":[null,null,{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"ground, land"},{"g":"to the"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"there is, there are"]]},{"text":"Ihr Herz pochte vor Aufregung.","en":"Her heart was throbbing with excitement.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"heart"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null]},{"text":"Ich konnte meine Aufregung kaum unterdrücken.","en":"I could barely contain my excitement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"barely, hardly"},{"g":"to suppress"}]},{"text":"Der neue Junge stotterte vor Aufregung.","en":"The new boy had a nervous stammer.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"boy"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null]}]}